WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Personalize settings — choosing what your widget can do

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Settings sits on your widget card, next to the mode button

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Route to Human turns the AI off entirely — every chat goes to your team instead

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Tick the agents allowed to work in this chatbot

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Each one does a different job — dashboard help, site search, crypto, payments

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Agent 047 only works for signed-in users

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Agent 047 walks your dashboard, so it needs a sandbox login

8
00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Use a test account — never a real customer's

9
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Suggested questions are the prompts the widget offers first

10
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Keep them short — 27 characters each

11
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Save and close, and the widget picks it up
